THIS IS THEM MOST IMPORTANT PART FOR THEMING

1. Put the whole bin folder at ~/.local
2. Make those 3 folder executable by,
   chmod +x walset (you need cd to the ~/.local/bin and after use this cmd)
   chmod +x walset-backend
   chmod +x walset-random
3. And you are good to go (Also make sure to execute all the other .sh files or the files that contains "#!/bin/bash" line) 
